graph TD
    Start([开始]) --> Input[接收业务请求]
    Input --> Validate{参数校验}

    Validate -->|通过| Route{路由分发}
    Validate -->|失败| Error[返回错误信息]

    Route -->|查询| Query[查询服务]
    Route -->|写入| Write[写入服务]
    Route -->|审批| Approve[审批服务]

    Query --> Cache{命中缓存?}
    Cache -->|是| RespOK[组装成功响应]
    Cache -->|否| DB[(数据库)]
    DB --> RespOK

    Write --> Persist[(持久化)]
    Persist --> Event[发送领域事件]
    Event --> RespOK

    Approve --> Review{需要人工审批?}
    Review -->|是| Human[人工审批节点]
    Review -->|否| Auto[自动通过]
    Human --> RespOK
    Auto --> RespOK

    RespOK --> End([结束])
    Error --> End

    style Start fill:#4A90E2,stroke:#357ABD,color:#fff
    style End fill:#52C41A,stroke:#389E0D,color:#fff
    style Error fill:#FF6B6B,stroke:#CC5555,color:#fff
